# This site is deliberately dependency-free: plain HTML, CSS and vanilla JS,
# no build step, nothing to install. The previous .gitignore here was Vite
# boilerplate left over from an abandoned React scaffold — it ignored dist/ and
# node_modules/ that never existed, and said nothing about what's actually
# likely to land in this directory by accident.

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Local preview + scratch
.cache/
*.log

# Personal documents that are NOT for publication. resume.pdf IS published
# deliberately (data.js links it) — but the drafts it's built from carry a
# phone number and are not meant to be served to the open web.
resume-*.md
*-draft.*
*.docx

# If tooling is ever added (a TS build, a CSS pipeline), these become relevant.
# Harmless until then.
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
